# Everything here is regenerated by `bubblewrap build` from twa-manifest.json.
# Only the manifest and our own docs are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!twa-manifest.json
!README.md
!STORE_LISTING.md
!DATA_SAFETY_CHECKLIST.md

# Never allow a keystore to slip in even if the ignore pattern above is loosened later.
*.keystore
*.jks
